h and loop.\n\nCareful: duplicate title risk between `[AC-017] n0` (confidence) and thresholds `unknown-none` no clash.\n\nPercent usage direct test title: `[AC-017] usage quantiles drive tasks left`.\n\nCV test: `[AC-017] confidence follows coefficient of variation`.\n\nWall clock test: `[AC-017] buildForecast ignores the wall clock`.\n\nTypeError: `[AC-017] buildForecast rejects a non-finite now`.\n\nNow forecast-unknown.test.mjs:\n\n```js\nconst schema = ...\nconst reasons = registry.forecast_reasons\nfunction forecast(quota, samples = []) { ... }\ntest('[AC-018] assumed estimate never becomes risk', ...)\ntest('[AC-018] capacity without a fraction stays unknown', ...)\ntest('[AC-018] credits without a rate stay unknown', ...)\ntest('[AC-018] empty quota is unknown with a registered reason', ...)\ntest('[AC-018] every no-sample output validates and never claims tasks', ...)\n```\n\nCareful: `assert.deepStrictEqual` for keys, plus validate.\n\nreset.test.mjs as described.\n\nLet me now write these files.\n\nOne more consideration in pool tests: `buildForecast({ quota: item.input.quota, ... })` — item.input.samples present for all 9 cases (yes, all have samples, some []). ✓\n\nNow writing.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b769a1b5702aa92833dbee5b67a6","_messageId":"01a1b76cf17e76c1ac5e288db65c932a","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b769a1b5702aa92833dbee5b67a6","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b76cf17e76c1ac5e288db65c932a","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b76cf17e76c1ac5e288db65c932a","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b76c-f17e-76c1-ac5e-288f023a7f6a","traceparent":"00-ca409312e57460dad670bff2ccb3f3ff-0161882b422c291a-01","baggage":"codebuddy.s