{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b76d-1ad8-7515-88d8-5e8627a19a5e","session_id":"01a1b769-9e30-7c78-9a9c-20b26d74eef6","message":{"id":"01a1b76d1ad8751588d85e8402139c51","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Oops — I named the b44 golden variable `pools` which shadows nothing but then `remainingForModels({ pools: item.input.pools ...})` fine. No conflict. OK.\n\nNow forecast-engine.test.mjs.\n\nDesign: `fn` dispatch table. I'll build mapping with keys matching golden `fn`.\n\nTest titles: `[AC-017] ${item.id}`.\n\nCounts: exact titles.\n\nAlso need `[AC-017] tasks-0`, `frac-0.15`, `n2-invalid`, `n20-heavy`, `n20-cv1.01`, `n3-cv5`, `eta-equal-reset`, `round3-negative`.\n\nWrite.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b769a1b5702aa92833dbee5b67a6","_messageId":"01a1b76d1ad8751588d85e8402139c51","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b769a1b5702aa92833dbee5b67a6","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b76d1ad8751588d85e8402139c51","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b76d1ad8751588d85e8402139c51","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b76d-1ad8-7515-88d8-5e8627a19a5e","traceparent":"00-ca409312e57460dad670bff2ccb3f3ff-0161882b422c291a-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b769-9e30-7c78-9a9c-20b26d74eef6,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b769a1b5702aa92833dbee5b67a6"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T19:12:29.402Z"}
