{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b76d-3302-709f-b6ce-1b780cced4a2","session_id":"01a1b769-9e30-7c78-9a9c-20b26d74eef6","message":{"id":"01a1b76d330178299d5a5a0b366463cd","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now forecast-unknown.test.mjs.\n\nRequirements from AC-018:\n- No samples → tasks_left null, tasks_left_assumed from usage_estimate_mtok, basis none, confidence none.\n- with fraction → risk from fraction only; else unknown.\n- assumed never yields ok/critical.\n- neither capacity nor fraction → status/risk unknown, reason in registry enum.\n- Validate against schema.\n- sweep: for all no-sample inputs, risk_basis !== 'tasks' and risk not in {ok, critical} unless fraction basis.\n\nHmm the sweep wording: \"遍历所有无样本输入断言 risk_basis !== 'tasks' 且 risk ∉ {ok, critical}（除非 fraction 依据）\". So for inputs without fraction, risk must not be ok/critical.\n\nWrite.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b769a1b5702aa92833dbee5b67a6","_messageId":"01a1b76d330178299d5a5a0b366463cd","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b769a1b5702aa92833dbee5b67a6","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b76d330178299d5a5a0b366463cd","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b76d330178299d5a5a0b366463cd","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b76d-3302-709f-b6ce-1b780cced4a2","traceparent":"00-ca409312e57460dad670bff2ccb3f3ff-0161882b422c291a-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b769-9e30-7c78-9a9c-20b26d74eef6,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b769a1b5702aa92833dbee5b67a6"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T19:12:36.101Z"}
